sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Application Backend
    participant B as Bale Business API
    participant C as Existing private chat

    A->>A: Resolve known private chat_id
    A->>A: Check intent, recipient and application idempotency
    A->>B: sendMessage or another documented method
    B->>C: Deliver notification
    B-->>A: Provider response
    A->>A: Persist delivery result and correlation data

    Note over A,B: No Safir-style provider request_id is documented for Business API
    Note over B,C: Business API supports private chats and file_id-only media
